FORMAT & DEPTH EXAMPLE — END. Every real problem block below MUST match this structure and BRIEF depth. This example governs ONLY the ASSESSMENT & PLAN section — every other section MUST still be rendered per FULL_NOTE_ALL_SECTIONS_REQUIRED_LOCK.}}

